name: Petroglyph — lower ante
author: corpus
description: >-
  Petroglyph lowers the current Ante by 1 but reduces discards per round by 1. Tier-2 voucher:
  requires Hieroglyph bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases:
  lower ante, more scaling time, extra shops, long run setup.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Petroglyph
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: Yorick
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Castle
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - voucher: Wasteful
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
